PDQ and vPDQ for Go
Copyright (c) 2026, Common Data Incorporated.

This product includes software developed by Common Data Incorporated as
part of the Common Data platform, reproducing the output of Meta's PDQ
and vPDQ reference implementations in the ThreatExchange project
(https://github.com/facebook/ThreatExchange, BSD-3-Clause): the pdq
package matches pdqhash-python bit for bit wherever the decoded pixel
bytes agree, and the vpdq package matches the C++ vPDQ frame for frame
given x86-64 ffmpeg. Decoder and platform differences are documented in
the README.

Test fixtures include content from facebook/ThreatExchange
(BSD-3-Clause): the bridge photograph in testdata/ (pdq/data/bridge-mods)
and the sample-video lineage in vpdq/testdata/ (doorknob.mp4 and its
derivatives).
